{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 74377, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 52914, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "双重-无限制本源-乱斗", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1618912650, "updated_at": 1700048020, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1689004789, "last_at": 1700048020, "comment_count": 6, "status": 1, "summary": "前言一、什么是双重乱斗二、为什么要参加双重乱斗三、怎么玩好双重乱斗本帖在LIMIA前辈的基础之上修改感谢各位前辈对百科的建设一、什么是双重乱斗0、双重估计指的是乱上加乱吧1、双重乱斗的战斗方式与，常驻", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_442/h_507/1069/87565/2022/9/1/201980.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_597/1069/87565/2022/9/1/396096.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_510/h_534/1069/87565/2022/9/1/764886.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 17, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 29766, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 1, "audit_uid": 448923, "favorite_count": 3, "seo": "{\"title\":\"\",\"desc\":\"\",\"key\":\"\"}", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 74377, "content": "<span><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">前言</span></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">一、什么是双重乱斗&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;二、为什么要参加双重乱斗&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;三、怎么玩好双重乱斗</div><div></div></span><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">本帖在LIMIA前辈的基础之上修改</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">感谢各位前辈对百科的建设</span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">一、什么是双重乱斗</span></div></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">0、双重估计指的是乱上加乱吧</span></div><div>1、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">双重乱斗的战斗方式与，常驻无限制（5星）乱斗的战斗方式一致。</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">2、不一致的为天子的参赛规则与额外BUFF</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;每一期会禁用一种属性的全部天子（光暗水火木），说不定也会禁类型（刀防辅扰奶）。</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;每一期会随机禁用几名天子（一般禁还是乱斗pvp强力天子）</span></div><div>3、有门票限制，如果北京时间早3点，你的门票不足1，自动补充一张。每日可够买2张门票，每张1500钻石。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></span></div><div>4、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">胜场数越多负场数越少得分越高</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">每票最高得分750分</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></span></div><div>5、完成一轮需要取胜12次，最多可以允许失败2次，失败3次则本轮提前结束。</div><div>6、这是一个周期出现的限时活动，前一周能打，后一周就只能干看着。</div><div></div></span><div><br></div><div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">进入场地参加活动位置请参考乱斗</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">规则截图参考</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"442\" data-height=\"507\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_442/h_507/1069/87565/2022/9/1/201980.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_442/h_507/1069/87565/2022/9/1/201980.png\"><img data-width=\"512\" data-height=\"597\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_597/1069/87565/2022/9/1/396096.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_597/1069/87565/2022/9/1/396096.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"510\" data-height=\"534\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_510/h_534/1069/87565/2022/9/1/764886.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_510/h_534/1069/87565/2022/9/1/764886.png\"><img data-width=\"516\" data-height=\"446\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_516/h_446/1069/87565/2022/9/1/814591.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_516/h_446/1069/87565/2022/9/1/814591.png\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">二、为什么要参与</span></div></div><br></div></span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">奖励丰厚，对于有天子池有点家底的玩家，获得奖励都简单</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1、堪比RB的奖励，挂机就一天拿三次</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2、常驻奖励有点火石、天子11连券（量不少挺多的）</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">3、每赛季第一次获得11连胜有额外奖励，一般包括（双重乱斗门票、5星天子兑换券，天子选择箱，点火石随机箱）</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">4、赛季任务奖励（详情见图片参考）</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">5、RANK（排名）奖励</span></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">奖励图片参考</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"519\" data-height=\"669\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_519/h_669/1069/87565/2022/9/1/420547.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_519/h_669/1069/87565/2022/9/1/420547.png\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"522\" data-height=\"538\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_522/h_538/1069/87565/2022/9/1/447377.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_522/h_538/1069/87565/2022/9/1/447377.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"519\" data-height=\"110\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_519/h_110/1069/87565/2022/9/1/795080.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_519/h_110/1069/87565/2022/9/1/795080.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:center;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"464\" data-height=\"125\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_464/h_125/1069/87565/2022/9/1/803237.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_464/h_125/1069/87565/2022/9/1/803237.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"559\" data-height=\"613\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_559/h_613/1069/87565/2022/9/1/688769.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_559/h_613/1069/87565/2022/9/1/688769.png\"><img data-width=\"558\" data-height=\"453\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_558/h_453/1069/87565/2022/9/1/285576.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_558/h_453/1069/87565/2022/9/1/285576.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"557\" data-height=\"451\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_557/h_451/1069/87565/2022/9/1/900991.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_557/h_451/1069/87565/2022/9/1/900991.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"556\" data-height=\"161\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_556/h_161/1069/87565/2022/9/1/998379.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_556/h_161/1069/87565/2022/9/1/998379.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"452\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_452/1069/87565/2022/9/1/78823.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_452/1069/87565/2022/9/1/78823.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"558\" data-height=\"453\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_558/h_453/1069/87565/2022/9/1/329966.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_558/h_453/1069/87565/2022/9/1/329966.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"582\" data-height=\"675\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_582/h_675/1069/87565/2022/9/1/984119.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_582/h_675/1069/87565/2022/9/1/984119.png\"></div>金总赔的都坐公交了</div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div></span><div></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">三、怎么参与双重乱斗</span></div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1、玩家问的最多的问题：要不要花钻石买门票(不重置你赔的连公交都坐不起，<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">对就是三个月前的我)</span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1个点火石材料=50钻，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;一张11连券=11×86.22%=9.484个3星天子，一个三星天子挖矿=30钻+1个2星天子+20钻=50钻</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;50×9.4842=474.21钻石</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">那么可以得出：1张门票=1500钻石</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;12胜=6个11连券×474.21+50点火石材料×50钻石=2845.26+2500=5345.25钻石</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;11胜=5<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">个11连券×474.21+40点火石材料×50钻石=2371.05+2000=4371.05钻石</span></span></div><div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;10胜=5<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">个11连券×474.21+30点火石材料×50钻石=2371.05+1500=3871.05钻石</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;9胜=4<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">个11连券×474.21+30点火石材料×50钻石=1896.48+1500=3396.84钻石</span></span></div><div style=\"\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;8胜=4</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">个11连券×474.21+20点火石材料×50钻石=<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">1896.48</span>+1000=2896.84钻石</span><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;7胜=3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">个11连券×474.21+20点火石材料×50钻石=<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">1422.63</span>+1000=2422.63钻石</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">\n\n</div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;6胜=3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">个11连券×474.21+10点火石材料×50钻石=<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">1422.63</span>+500&nbsp; =1922.63钻石</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5胜=2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">个11连券×474.21+10点火石材料×50钻石=<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">948.42&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>+500&nbsp; =1448.42钻石</span></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;挖矿用不着那么多金币而且还能回血金币，当然用免费的体力挖矿不费金币。</span><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、由于其限制出场的规则与BUFF导致，参与天子变得不像平时5星乱斗阵容，先不考虑RANK榜上的阵容，在中端局上老玩家掏出PVP下岗天子足以横扫这个活动了例如：小天鹅、甜甜圈、木丽莎、九尾、水丽莎、独角兽、木嫦娥、嫦娥、牡丹、</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、未证实的偏门，如果你争取不到好的排名奖励，那么可以考虑可以压制胜场，即在11连胜以后切换2队故意输两把，将自己的Rank分故意保持在不高的情况，防止分值过高以后挂机三连败没拿到12连胜。(11连和12连差距1000钻)</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div></span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">低端局账号获得奖励建议</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">在主页参考各位高玩的攻略</span></div></span><span><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></span>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_442/h_507/1069/87565/2022/9/1/201980.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_597/1069/87565/2022/9/1/396096.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_510/h_534/1069/87565/2022/9/1/764886.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "description": "DC混了一年半，好好玩半年，又要开始混了。", "follow_num": 141, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "不忘初心", "tag_color": "#FEC700"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 5, "content_at": 87603334, "content_num": 27, "read_num": 1273844, "like_num": 691}, "update_user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "description": "DC混了一年半，好好玩半年，又要开始混了。", "follow_num": 141, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 5, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "last_ip_area": "吉林省", "last_login_device_num": 1}, {"uid": 92835, "username": "海洋饼干", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/5.png", "last_ip_area": "安徽省", "last_login_device_num": 1}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_